submode-mode      both  -  clean    <MODE>SSB <SUBMODE>USB
mode-missing      both  -  warning  bare <QSO_DATE>20240115 <TIME_ON>1830 <CALL>WF1B <BAND>20m <SUBMODE>USB
mode-missing      both  -  clean    <MODE>SSB <SUBMODE>USB
freq-band         both  -  warning  <FREQ>7.1
