# ── User-defined fields (§IV.A.5, §IV.B.3) ──
userdef-id        both  -  warning  <ADIF_VER>3.1.8 <USERDEF0:N>EPC || <EPC>1
userdef-id        both  -  clean    <ADIF_VER>3.1.8 <USERDEF1:N>EPC || <EPC>1
