userdef-name      both  -  clean    <ADIF_VER>3.1.8 <USERDEF1:S>MYFIELD || <MYFIELD>x
userdef-values    both  -  error    <ADIF_VER>3.1.8 <USERDEF1:N>SHOESIZE,{20:5} || <SHOESIZE>10
